{"articleNo":"502459","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=502459&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[수업] [진로교육] 2024년 2학기 취업진로교육 대체이수 신청 접수 안내-본문 메일주소 수정","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2024.11.26","hit":"11697","attachments":[{"name":"2024년 2학기 취업진로교육 온라인 대체이수 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=502459&attachNo=139008"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; margin-left: 15.4pt; text-align: center; text-indent: -15.4pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼고딕; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">2024년 2학기 취업진로교육 대체이수 신청 접수 안내</span></strong></span></strong></span></p><p><strong></strong></p><p><b>메일주소: <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">cat79@kumoh.ac.kr</span> 입니다.</b></p><p><strong>=============================================================================================</strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">이전 취업진로교육 미이수자&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">혹은&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">역학기 복학 등</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;으로</span>&nbsp;이전학기(학년) 취업진로교육을 이수하지 못한&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">4학년 이상 재학생 및 수료생</span>은</strong></p><p><strong>취업진로교육 대체이수로 신청하세요</strong></p><p><strong><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼고딕; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">- 신청대상 : 4학년 이상 및 수료생(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\">1~3학년</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">은 4학년부터&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">신청하세요)</span></span></strong></span></span></strong></strong></strong><br></p><p><strong><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼고딕; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(102, 232, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- 제출기간 : <span style=\"background-color: rgb(102, 232, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">12월 1일~</span></span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(102, 232, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;1</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(102, 232, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">월 30일까지</span>(계약학과, IT융합학과, 외국인 유학생 제외)</span></span></strong></span></span></strong></strong></strong></p><p><strong><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼고딕; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">-&nbsp;</span></strong></span></span></strong></strong></strong><strong><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼고딕; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">LMS수강</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">+대체이수신청=</span></span></strong></span></span></strong></strong></strong><strong><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼고딕; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">4개 과목 이상 이수 신청자</span>는 진로취업상담실(학생회관 1층)에서 상담 1회 후 이수가능</span></strong></span></span></strong></strong></strong></p><p><strong><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼고딕; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(102, 232, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;(</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">상담신청: 학생역량관리시스템-통합상담-상담관리-진로취업상담</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">)</span></span></strong></span></span></strong></strong></strong><br></p><p></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"6776\"></div><p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 70.2pt; text-indent: -70.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">예시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: LMS 1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">과목 수강</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">+</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">대체이수&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">과목 신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, LMS 2</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">과목 수강&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">+&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">대체이수&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"HCI Poppy\">2</font></span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">과목 신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">대체이수&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">과목 이상 신청 등</span></p><p>- 전화문의 : 054-478-7984<br></p><p><strong style=\"text-indent: -77pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\"><br></span></strong></p><p><strong style=\"text-indent: -77pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">온라인강좌 신청방법</span></strong><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 77pt; text-indent: -77pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">한국고용정보원 사이버진로교육센터</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">–</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">교육안내-</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">온라인교육</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">-</font></span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">청년 클릭</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 77pt; text-indent: -77pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"굴림\">(http://www.work.go.kr/cyberedu/main.do)</font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 60pt; text-indent: -60pt; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmBYHoQVkgbASvAtgMQJ4FcAKBhDAJ0IGkMBxACwHsBDRWgOgCkdyg%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 60pt; text-indent: -60pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 77pt; text-indent: -77pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">※&nbsp;<